stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> SignupInitiated: Worker signs up
    
    SignupInitiated --> PersonalfragebogenInProgress: Starts form
    PersonalfragebogenInProgress --> PersonalfragebogenCompleted: Submits form
    
    PersonalfragebogenCompleted --> DocumentCollectionInProgress: Starts chatbot
    DocumentCollectionInProgress --> DocumentsCollected: Uploads all docs
    
    DocumentsCollected --> FamiliarizationPeriod: Optional trial
    DocumentsCollected --> ContractGenerated: Trial skipped
    FamiliarizationPeriod --> ContractGenerated: Trial finished
    
    ContractGenerated --> ContractSigned: Manager confirms signature
    
    ContractSigned --> AwaitingManagerReview: Enters pool (target HotelGroup)
    
    AwaitingManagerReview --> UnderManagerReview: Claimed by Manager/RM
    
    UnderManagerReview --> Approved: Manager/RM approves
    UnderManagerReview --> Rejected: Manager/RM rejects
    
    Approved --> [*]: Transition to Active (Scope Assigned)
    Rejected --> [*]: Transition to Rejected
